  "year": "207",
  "summary": [
    "Liu Biao's wife's family decide to be rid of Liu Bei at a banquet. Warned mid-course, he goes over the wall to his horse and finds the road blocked by the Tan Stream, deep and fast and thirty feet across.",
    "The horse Dilu, which he has been warned is unlucky and will one day kill its master, gathers itself and clears it."
  ],
  "history": "The leap is legend rather than record, and the novel knows it — the whole point of Dilu is the prophecy it is busy contradicting.",
